Z||000000||bszopi||11-07-2001||07:23 PM||||I have read about you guys doing 3.4 DOHC conversions, and utilizing the 16149396 ECM. I am currently trying to do a ECM swap with a 16149396 ECM, but I can't seem to find a reliable source for the pinouts for the ECM. Does anyone know where I can get them from? Or, so those of you that have done the swaps, do you have the pinouts? I need the pinouts for an automatic (yeah, I know... blah!!). If anyone can provide me with some information, it would be greatly appreciated!!<P>-Brad||||reg||1
Z||000001||FormulaJoe||11-07-2001||07:54 PM||||I would be interested in this info myself.  I will soon be putting a '91 3.4 DOHC into my '88 Formula.  Mechanicaly it looks fairly easy, the wiring looks to be the big thing.||||reg||6
